    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your lighter close, it's dark out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of Seph, an artistically inclined child who embarks on a sprawling journey across their unusual world- all just to get food for their dog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the topsy-turvy lands of this world as you make some new friends, meet peculiar citizens, fight off nightmarish creatures, and uncover dark and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D RPG gameplay with minor platforming elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several distinct areas to explore with branching pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies to encounter, each presenting their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system based around Seph's art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of peculiar characters scattered throughout the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 recruitable friends to travel and fight along side you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dog</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your lighter close, it's dark out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of Seph, an artistically inclined child who embarks on a sprawling journey across their unusual world- all just to get food for their dog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the topsy-turvy lands of this world as you make some new friends, meet peculiar citizens, fight off nightmarish creatures, and uncover dark and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D RPG gameplay with minor platforming elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several distinct areas to explore with branching pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies to encounter, each presenting their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system based around Seph's art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of peculiar characters scattered throughout the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 recruitable friends to travel and fight along side you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dog</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the dreary world of Little One, an atmospheric 2D RPG, as you meet the unusual inhabitants and fight off the monsters that lurk in its darkest corners.",
